{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-meet-science2-27","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":27,"points":null,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"카이랄·chiral·E)","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_rxn"],"stem":"젖산(CH3CHOHCOOH)의\n라세미\n혼합물(racemate)을\n분할\n(resolution)할때<보기>에서옳은것을모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 카이랄(chiral) 탄소가있어서분별증류로분리할수있다.\nㄴ. 카이랄고정상을갖는크로마토그래피로분리할수있다.\nㄷ. 카이랄아미노산과반응하여생성된염을재결정하여\n분리할수있다.\nㄹ. 카이랄알코올과반응시켜에스터(ester)를만든후\n분별증류로분리할수있다.\nㅁ. 카이랄탄소를산화시킨후다시환원시키면분별증류로\n분리할수있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ, ㅁ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":744,"height":452,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,53.456,297.6,180.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-27/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[373.089,682.144,690.55,958.892],"width":317.462,"height":276.748,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.111,53.456,297.6,180.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"27. 젖산(CH3CHOHCOOH)의","bbox":[5.0,5.0,138.069,11.44],"spans":[{"text":"27.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.99,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T10"},{"text":" 젖","bbox":[17.99,5.0,16.317,11.032],"origin":[17.99,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T17"},{"text":"산","bbox":[33.779,5.0,10.48,11.032],"origin":[33.779,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"